  "releaseNotes": "1.3.2 - packaging only. Release assemblies no longer embed the build machine's symbol path, so the published package does not disclose the builder's local file system. No functional change from 1.3.1, whose notes follow. 1.3.1 - AI moderation calls now time out after 8 seconds and fall back to the deterministic rules verdict, so a stalled provider can no longer hold a member's submit request open. Works with Community Forum, Community Comments, or both. See CHANGELOG.md.",
